# Music sketch: chase. 120 bpm, 8 bars (16 s loop): pulsing low square
# ostinato with semitone tension, heartbeat kick on the beat, dissonant
# stabs on each bar, a rising noise swell into the loop point.
@output ../music/chase_loop.wav
@length 16.0
@rate 22050
@seed 54
@peak -2
@loop 0.2
@echo 0.25 0.25 0.2
